# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Planning Hub

Welcome to the planning hub for **{{PROJECT_NAME}}**.

This interactive documentation site provides comprehensive SDLC artifacts across all project phases, from initial requirements through deployment and maintenance.

## What is the Planning Hub?

The Planning Hub is a centralized, interactive documentation platform built with Storybook that brings together all your project artifacts in one place:

- **Living Documentation** - Artifacts update automatically as your project evolves
- **Interactive Visualizations** - View architecture diagrams, API specs, and user flows
- **Team Collaboration** - Share a single source of truth with stakeholders
- **Version Controlled** - All artifacts are tracked in git alongside code

